00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,850
and the STL Standard
Template Library.

3
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:08,040
On introduce C++ templates,

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:12,100
introduce STL library
and introduce boost.

5
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:15,045
With C and C++,

6
00:00:15,045 --> 00:00:17,400
and it's called strong typing,

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,675
what it means is that

8
00:00:18,675 --> 00:00:20,445
anytime we're using
different types,

9
00:00:20,445 --> 00:00:21,900
even if it's for a function that

10
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,240
does essentially the same thing,

