27
00:01:13,789 --> 00:01:15,590
One is that parameters

28
00:01:15,590 --> 00:01:17,855
by default aren't going
to be type checked.

29
00:01:17,855 --> 00:01:19,640
You're not checking to make sure

30
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,830
