34
00:01:28,115 --> 00:01:31,040
There are ways to do
that with macros,

35
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:33,125
but this example doesn't
show it and it's

36
00:01:33,125 --> 00:01:36,100
not automatically done for you.

37
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,880
Then also parameters aren't

38
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,505
evaluated before you
paste into the macro.

39
00:01:40,505 --> 00:01:42,575
In other words, if this

40
00:01:42,575 --> 00:01:44,735
is something other than
a simple expression,

41
00:01:44,735 --> 00:01:47,420
if there's some logic
that happens with it,

42
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:48,680
that logic is going to get

43
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:51,295
repeated when it's
