44
00:01:51,295 --> 00:01:54,825
An example of when
this is important,

45
00:01:54,825 --> 00:01:58,175
if you're taking
a macro argument,

46
00:01:58,175 --> 00:02:00,290
it'll just be pasted directly

47
00:02:00,290 --> 00:02:02,700
in including any expression
