48
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:06,405
For instance, if I tried to
use min with ++ and I say,

49
00:02:06,405 --> 00:02:09,570
if I start with i10 and
j5 and I tried to take

50
00:02:09,570 --> 00:02:14,445
the min ++i, ++j,

51
00:02:14,445 --> 00:02:16,395
I might expect here

52
00:02:16,395 --> 00:02:18,680
that m is going to end
up with a value of

