that happen

67
00:02:52,330 --> 00:02:54,460
as a result of a macro.

68
00:02:54,460 --> 00:02:59,465
We can avoid this with C++
using template functions.

69
00:02:59,465 --> 00:03:01,945
A template function
is one where the type

